  "content": {
    "component": "news_article",
    "_uid": "390-root",
    "title": "Awareness session on personal safety",
    "subtitle": null,
    "summary": "In recent years, AKU has been affected by the deteriorating security situation of the city, directly or indirectly, where employees have been victims of street crime and received threats.",
    "media": [
      {
        "_uid": "424f4990b38750a3",
        "component": "news_media",
        "role": "banner",
        "filename": "390-BannerImage.jpg",
        "src": "/news-media/390-BannerImage.jpg",
        "media_type": "image",
        "caption": null,
        "alt": "Awareness session on personal safety"
      }
    ],
    "body": {
      "type": "doc",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The mega city of Karachi is facing many troubles, one of the most problematic being street crime. Snatching of money and valuables including cars/bikes and mobile phones are on the rise as are more serious crimes such as and with target killing, extortion, kidnapping and abduction."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The Aga Khan University employees thousands of people associated with the fields of healthcare and education, not only locals but also foreigners who reside in Karachi or visit here for different purposes."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "In recent years, AKU has been affected by the deteriorating security situation of the city, directly or indirectly, where employees have been victims of street crime and received threats."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "To equip its employees with best practices in terms of personal safety, the Department of Safety and Security organized an information-packed interactive session on the current crime scenario in Karachi."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "During the session Colonel Salim Rehman, Director, Safety and Security shared specific instructions on how to deal with various crimes. He also narrated instances about affected AKU family members. The audience participated enthusiastically and asked a number of questions regarding safety matters."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
